--><rss xmlns:sparkle="http://www.andymatuschak.org/xml-namespaces/sparkle" version="2.0"><channel><title>AndroidADBTool 更新</title><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>AndroidADBTool 1.0.21</title><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:47:45 GMT</pubDate><sparkle:version>20261126154211</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.21</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;新增 Windows x64 测试版，内置 ADB，支持独立窗口投屏与无音频录屏；部分 Mac 原生功能仍在适配。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;设置 → 应用更新新增“下载与使用说明”，点击后用默认浏览器打开当前电脑上的内置页面，无需配置地址或依赖其他电脑。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;安装说明、图文使用说明及版本记录随工具打包，可离线浏览；下载安装包时才需要联网。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;下载与使用页面沿用统一样式，通过顶部标签切换下载安装、使用说明和版本记录。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;本版基于主线功能，不包含多语言走查实验功能。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/zj-kechangjie/android_tool_plus-updates/releases/download/v1.0.21/AndroidADBTool-1.0.21-20261126154211-AppleSilicon.zip" length="54978406" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="CuSC0F+33Lm4JN6fe2ZGocencmRlgqm0XoK+Re750sIQIVwQC/hTOP1grAfg86vEwL+vvYXzDTn2+imXwHdHBA=="></enclosure><sparkle:deltas><enclosure url="https://github.com/zj-kechangjie/android_tool_plus-updates/releases/download/v1.0.21/AndroidADBTool-1.0.21-20261126154211-from-20261125182328-AppleSilicon.delta" length="3040074" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:deltaFrom="20261125182328" sparkle:edSignature="wF734ZVyrsXQYzxM794UcOh9gyvVUPk78Lmw8QpOvHzwQ5YOZfHWF8wn2cVV1lHuSD5jcHwbj+0wEvSrzg/3Cg==" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleExecutableSize="977616" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleLocales="Base,ar,ca,cs,da,de,el,es,fa,fi,fr,he,hr,hu,is,it,ja,ko,nb,nl,nn,pl,pt-BR,pt-PT,ro,ru,sk,sl,sv,th,tr,uk,vi,zh_CN,zh_HK,zh_TW"></enclosure><enclosure url="https://github.com/zj-kecha